{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-558a5060de215d50e32f","statement":"The Lie superalgebras $\\fsl(n,n)$ and $A(n,n)$ are isomorphic, respectively, to $[\\fgl(n,n),\\fgl(n,n)]$ and $[\\fgl(n,n),\\fgl(n,n)]/C$, where $C = \\C h_0$ is the one-dimensional center of $\\fsl(n,n)$. For these Lie superalgebras the set $\\{h_\\alpha\\mid \\alpha\\in \\dot{\\S}\\}$ is no longer linearly independent, and, as a consequence, we are not allowed to talk about systems of simple roots as we do for the other cases.","source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"a43cdf99773bbbd24af574d0f60fb6ad054e0984e74de97bf7daf43c2b612ba1","kind":"remark","label":"Remark 1","ref_key":"rmk:fix.not.A(n,n).sl(n,n)","name":"","order":1,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"e37835a9f6b4274c653d65dc7a6ff66cac496d5a54d71d1e3faf4b1bf01adf27","line":355,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:16:48+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":418,"math_hints":28}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","title":"Highest weight modules for affine Lie superalgebras","abstract":"We describe Borel and parabolic subalgebras of affine Lie superalgebras and study the Verma type modules associated to such subalgebras. We give necessary and sufficient conditions under which these modules are simple.","authors":["Lucas Calixto","Vyacheslav Futorny"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"C":"\\mathbb{C}","Z":"\\mathbb{Z}","st":"\\mathrm{st}","nat":"\\mathrm{nat}","g":"\\mathfrak{g}","fm":"\\mathfrak{m}","fh":"\\mathfrak{h}","fn":"\\mathfrak{n}","fb":"\\mathfrak{b}","fsl":"\\mathfrak{sl}","fpsl":"\\mathfrak{psl}","fosp":"\\mathfrak{osp}","fgl":"\\mathfrak{gl}","fu":"\\mathfrak{u}"